            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion and enthusiasm!\r\n\r\nAnd \"endwise\"-like functionality was one of the first module suggestions (#9). My point mentioned there (that to me it looks more like a job for snippets) still stands. And as Neovim added built-in snippet support only in current Nightly (0.10), it got delayed more than I anticipated.\r\n\r\nSo as 'mini.snippets' is indeed (hopefully) closer than ever, I am going to close with suggestion to adapt snippets for this kind of tasks.",
